The kernels in _kernels.pyx are a Cython port of solver.py and burn_rate.py from srm_1d
(https://github.com/eJar0k/srm_1d), MIT License, copyright its author. The numerics are those of the
original, checked against it on the same inputs; the energy diagnostics and ignition-only helpers
were left out. The upstream repository declares MIT in pyproject.toml but ships no LICENSE
file; replace this notice with the upstream copyright line once confirmed.

Ma, Y. et al. (2020). A New Erosive Burning Model of Solid Propellant Based
on Heat Transfer Equilibrium at Propellant Surface.
Int. J. Aerospace Eng., 2020, 8889333.
